# SDD scratch workspace (ledger, briefs, review packages)
.superpowers/

# Agent tooling installed by plugins, not project source. Ignored for the same
# reason `.superpowers/` is: it is how the assistant is configured, it arrives
# and changes independently of this codebase, and a `git add -A` during
# unrelated work otherwise sweeps ~170 vendored files into a product commit --
# which is exactly what happened once before this line existed.
#
# If these should be versioned, that is a deliberate decision and deserves its
# own commit rather than a side effect of one.
.agents/skills/
.claude/skills/
skills-lock.json
